57
00:05:02,022 --> 00:05:09,466
This is research that reports on evidence for air breathing ability in sea scorpions.

58
00:05:10,107 --> 00:05:11,067
Oh, like dry air?

59
00:05:11,247 --> 00:05:13,088
Dry air. Out on the land.

60
00:05:13,228 --> 00:05:15,310
That's even more horrifying than they were beforehand.

61
00:05:16,610 --> 00:05:20,352
This is research in current biology by James Lambsdell et al.

62
00:05:20,753 --> 00:05:27,256
Fun fact, James Lambsdell, one of the hosts and creators of Paleo After Dark, fellow paleontology podcast.

63
